# Global launcher command list: "alias|command" per line.
# The alias is shown in the fuzzy picker; the command is pasted to the
# terminal (not executed) when selected. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The alias must not contain a literal "|" - the command can. Icons are
# just plain characters at the start of the alias - add your own to taste.

 my jiras|jira list --mine
 open jira|jira open
 jira dashboard|jira list --sprint "Core Storage Infra Blr H126-7"
 open pagerduty|pagerduty open --urgency high
 on-call who|pd oncall
